    heroEyebrow: "Agent-first content framework",
    heroTitleMiddle: "A content framework built for",
    heroSrTitle: "A content framework built for agents.",
    heroDesc: "Start with content. Your agent turns an idea, brief, or source folder into an inspectable, editable workspace. There is no fixed template or single path, so you decide what to make and how it should take shape.",
